      "title": "Retirement: DCsv3 and DCdsv3-series Azure Virtual Machines will be retired on October 31, 2029",
      "description": "<p>On October 31,&nbsp;2029,&nbsp;DCsv3 and DCdsv3-series\nAzure&nbsp;Linux, Windows and Dedicated&nbsp;Host&nbsp;virtual\nmachines&nbsp;will be retired. After that date, they will no longer be\navailable for use or purchase.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>Before October 31, 2029, migrate your workloads to one of\nthe following options that best aligns with your business needs:&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><ul type=\"disc\">\n <li>To use\n     a VM-based programming model consider <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/virtual-machines/sizes/general-purpose/dcasv6-series?tabs=sizebasic\">DCasv6</a>/<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/virtual-machines/sizes/general-purpose/dcadsv6-series?tabs=sizebasic\">DCadsv6</a>/<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/virtual-machines/sizes/general-purpose/dcesv6-series?tabs=sizebasic\">DCesv6</a>/<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/virtual-machines/sizes/general-purpose/dcedsv6-series?tabs=sizebasic\">DCedsv6</a>\n     or memory optimized <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/virtual-machines/sizes/memory-optimized/ecasv6-series?tabs=sizebasic\">ECasv6</a>/<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/virtual-machines/sizes/memory-optimized/ecadsv6-series?tabs=sizebasic\">ECadsv6</a>/<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/virtual-machines/ecesv5-ecedsv5-series\">ECesv6</a>/<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/virtual-machines/ecedsv6-series\">ECedsv6</a>&nbsp;\n     series confidential VMs (CVMs),&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li></ul><ul type=\"disc\">\n <li>For\n     containerized applications, consider using&nbsp;<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/container-instances/container-instances-confidential-overview\">Azure\n     Confidential Container Instances (C-ACI)</a>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/container-instances/container-instances-virtual-nodes\">Virtual\n     nodes on Azure Container Instances (C-VN2)</a>&nbsp;for Azure Kubernetes\n     Service (AKS).&nbsp;&nbsp;</li></ul><p>Your billing may change. For details, see the Azure Virtual\nMachines <a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fazure.microsoft.com%2Fpricing%2Fdetails%2Fvirtual-machines%2Flinux-previous%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cmilicaspuzic%40microsoft.com%7Cf246ebc8018f44aebbf408defd414b16%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C639226654229819315%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=uZPFScnKY6uAcViggNeqZ8wv%2BCwurEb8aFEaRhy7kt0%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL: https://azure.microsoft.com/pricing/details/virtual-machines/linux-previous/. Click or tap if you trust this link.\">pricing\npage</a>.&nbsp;</p><p>Additionally,&nbsp;3-year&nbsp;and 1-year&nbsp;Reserved VM\nInstances (RIs) for these series will no longer be available for purchase or\nrenewal after October 31,&nbsp;2026.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><b>Required action&nbsp;</b></p><p>To avoid service disruptions, migrate your DCsv3 and/or\nDCdsv3-series VMs to one of the recommended options before October 31, 2029.</p><p>Starting&nbsp;November 1,&nbsp;2026, capacity restrictions\nwill be applied to DCsv3/DCdsv3-series VMs.&nbsp;</p><p><b>Help and support&nbsp;</b></p><p>For technical questions, issues, and help get answers in <a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flearn.microsoft.com%2Fsearch%2F%3Fterms%3Dconfidential%2520computing%26category%3DQnA&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cmilicaspuzic%40microsoft.com%7Cf246ebc8018f44aebbf408defd414b16%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C639226654229860908%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=uzviQzhmou32bIW%2FBMv9DJth4DVh8b9Tgx6gK%2Fw6NSU%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL: https://learn.microsoft.com/search/?terms=confidential%20computing&amp;category=QnA. Click or tap if you trust this link.\">Microsoft\nQ&amp;A</a>.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>Learn more:&nbsp;</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Faka.ms%2Fdcsv3-dcdsv3-series-retirement&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cmilicaspuzic%40microsoft.com%7Cf246ebc8018f44aebbf408defd414b16%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C639226654229839506%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=WvslONDsNGSd1rrwzOEJ%2BgvenYMpQze7aii9dMzx6Z0%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL: https://aka.ms/dcsv3-dcdsv3-series-retirement. Click or tap if you trust this link.\">Migration\nguide</a>&nbsp;</li><li><a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Faka.ms%2FServicesRetirementWorkbook&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cmilicaspuzic%40microsoft.com%7Cf246ebc8018f44aebbf408defd414b16%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C639226654229882799%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=XJ4faSHkFXJXD4PwDb0%2F0dPBzVQsDjaK%2BG0WpNxwdyw%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL: https://aka.ms/ServicesRetirementWorkbook. Click or tap if you trust this link.\">Azure\nRetirement Workbook</a> (<i>Please note that retirements may not be visible in\nthe workbook for up to two weeks after being announced)</i>&nbsp;</li></ul>",
